blank -> ValueError: 2000-01: GBP cell is '', not a decimal rate
n/a -> ValueError: 2000-01: GBP cell is 'n/a', not a decimal rate
zero -> ValueError: 2000-01: GBP rate must be positive
exponent -> ValueError: 2000-01: GBP cell is '1e-3', not a decimal rate
